WEBVTT

01:35.560 --> 01:36.840
But based on his age,

01:36.920 --> 01:40.200
he would have been just a child
the year my father had his incident.

01:40.800 --> 01:42.000
That doesn't add up.

01:42.640 --> 01:45.560
However,
if he's only involved in smuggling,

01:46.280 --> 01:49.080
why would he personally travel
such great distances to Yizhou?

01:50.120 --> 01:51.560
And later, when he approached me,

01:52.160 --> 01:53.560
what was he after?

02:00.880 --> 02:02.160
No need to rush.

02:02.960 --> 02:05.000
Leave these matters to me to investigate.

02:05.600 --> 02:06.680
Let me handle it.

02:07.200 --> 02:10.240
You have more pressing concerns.

02:11.320 --> 02:12.160
What concerns?

02:15.720 --> 02:19.000
The strange forces within the Yang family
aren't easy to deal with.

02:20.920 --> 02:21.880
Dear,

02:23.400 --> 02:24.440
you must be cautious.

02:46.880 --> 02:49.440
Why is everyone looking at me like that?

02:51.280 --> 02:52.960
Because you're so good-looking.

03:01.080 --> 03:02.160
Jinglan,

03:02.240 --> 03:03.720
this is a family banquet!

03:03.800 --> 03:07.000
Ever since you became the inspector,
you've been throwing your weight around.

03:07.080 --> 03:11.360
Did you even forget the old rule
that women aren't allowed

03:11.440 --> 03:13.640
to join a family banquet?

03:13.720 --> 03:17.000
Is this how you speak to an inspector?

03:17.080 --> 03:18.040
Alas.

03:18.120 --> 03:21.120
This is a family banquet,
not the Brocade Bureau.

03:21.200 --> 03:22.960
Is that how you talk to your elders?

03:24.080 --> 03:27.920
Yang Jinglin, did you forget
how I used to discipline you as a kid?

03:28.520 --> 03:32.160
Hey, chopsticks are for eating.
Stop pointing them at me.

03:32.880 --> 03:34.080
All right, enough.

03:35.600 --> 03:36.680
We're family.

03:36.760 --> 03:39.000
Can't we have one peaceful meal together?

03:41.360 --> 03:42.880
Jinglan's wife just joined the family,

03:42.960 --> 03:45.880
and our dinner table
can certainly accommodate her.

03:45.960 --> 03:51.960
The main point is to use this opportunity
to introduce her to the family elders.

03:53.600 --> 03:57.520
But no other family's daughters-in-law
have such privileges.

03:58.360 --> 03:59.480
Besides,

04:00.200 --> 04:03.880
Jinglan's wife didn't come here honorably.

04:04.440 --> 04:06.760
She's not qualified
for this grand occasion.

04:09.440 --> 04:10.560
Dear,

04:11.200 --> 04:12.360
look at these chopsticks.

04:12.440 --> 04:14.640
What kind of old, outworn wood
are they made from?

04:14.720 --> 04:16.920
How could they break so easily?

04:18.440 --> 04:19.640
Are you all right?

04:21.560 --> 04:23.360
I'll go get another pair of chopsticks.

04:27.640 --> 04:29.080
Jinglan says he's done eating.

04:29.760 --> 04:32.520
Sir, Madam, uncles,
we'll take our leave now.

04:32.600 --> 04:33.880
Yingying,

04:34.720 --> 04:35.720
sit down first.

04:42.000 --> 04:44.920
I allowed Yingying to join this banquet.

04:45.720 --> 04:47.080
I'm also a woman.

04:47.680 --> 04:51.600
I can attend this banquet
and manage our Yang family's business,

04:51.680 --> 04:55.920
thanks to the trust of all you elders.

04:56.680 --> 05:01.600
I invited Yingying
because she's no ordinary woman.

05:02.480 --> 05:04.680
She's not only the president
of the Bloom Society,

05:05.560 --> 05:09.000
but in the future, she'll also help manage
our Yang family's business.

05:10.360 --> 05:14.440
Attending a family banquet
is only a matter of time.

05:15.520 --> 05:17.840
There's no reason to make a fuss about it.

05:18.480 --> 05:20.920
Now that you've explained, I understand.

05:21.520 --> 05:22.880
The president of the Bloom Society

05:22.960 --> 05:25.040
is now a daughter-in-law
of our Yang family.

05:25.640 --> 05:29.400
So, the Bloom Society will eventually
come under our Yang family's name.

05:30.120 --> 05:31.360
Exactly.

05:31.440 --> 05:32.440
Sir.

05:33.360 --> 05:37.080
Now I see why this meal
was called together.

05:37.600 --> 05:39.680
It was a trap all along!

05:40.200 --> 05:42.080
- Jinglan.
- I'm not done yet.

05:42.960 --> 05:45.240
No matter how much
the Yang family has helped my wife,

05:45.760 --> 05:49.320
it doesn't justify taking her guild
as part of her dowry.

05:49.400 --> 05:51.280
Who does that kind of thing?

05:52.120 --> 05:53.320
He…

05:53.400 --> 05:54.680
Who are you talking about?

05:54.760 --> 05:56.040
Watch your tone!

05:58.080 --> 05:59.160
Don't worry, dear.

05:59.800 --> 06:03.720
Anyone who dares upset you,
I'll make sure they're even more upset.

06:03.800 --> 06:05.320
I'm curious to see

06:05.400 --> 06:09.720
whose head my first flames
as a new official will burn.

06:22.320 --> 06:23.520
This is boring.

06:24.320 --> 06:25.720
Even the food looks unappetizing.

06:26.440 --> 06:29.200
Dear, why don't we leave?

06:32.440 --> 06:35.680
Sir, Madam, uncles,
we're truly leaving now.

06:37.840 --> 06:39.360
Such a mess!

06:40.440 --> 06:41.920
- What did you say?
- Yang Jinglan!

06:42.440 --> 06:45.400
Juxian, look at his attitude!

06:45.480 --> 06:47.160
Exactly. Who does he mean
by "such a mess"?

06:47.240 --> 06:48.680
This meal

06:49.600 --> 06:51.640
is truly meaningless!

06:52.160 --> 06:53.080
I'm not eating anymore!

06:54.640 --> 06:57.440
Jingshan, escort Father back to rest.

06:57.520 --> 06:58.400
Okay.

07:07.240 --> 07:09.120
As expected,
they're not easy to deal with.

07:09.640 --> 07:11.760
They're even eyeing your guild.

07:13.600 --> 07:16.240
If Madam really wanted my Bloom Society,

07:16.760 --> 07:19.640
she would've come to negotiate directly.

07:20.160 --> 07:23.960
This only proves she wants more,
and her plans run deeper.

07:24.680 --> 07:28.320
This matriarch is not a bad person,
but her focus is entirely on business.

07:28.840 --> 07:29.880
Frankly,

07:30.400 --> 07:33.440
she's more of a Yang family member
than anyone else.

07:34.000 --> 07:36.720
That's why
she's the head lady of the house.

07:46.440 --> 07:48.920
In business, credibility is paramount.

07:49.440 --> 07:51.800
Even if she has her own agenda,

07:52.520 --> 07:55.400
I trust she'll deal with me fairly.

07:58.320 --> 07:59.400
But this Yang family

08:00.560 --> 08:02.280
is a large clan.

08:06.560 --> 08:10.920
Surviving in a family like this
is no different from doing business.

08:12.200 --> 08:15.080
If you start by showing your worst side,

08:15.160 --> 08:20.160
any small concession later
will make them think you're considerate.

08:21.400 --> 08:24.400
If you start by showing your best side,

08:24.480 --> 08:29.800
any tiny misstep will make them think
you're ungrateful and rebellious.

08:31.120 --> 08:33.159
Did you suffer a lot before?

08:34.880 --> 08:37.799
Some lessons can only be learned
through hardship.

08:39.039 --> 08:40.520
Of course not.

08:41.559 --> 08:43.720
I understand this because…

08:44.240 --> 08:45.480
I'm smart.

08:49.840 --> 08:52.000
You know this too.

08:52.520 --> 08:54.560
You're just too concerned
about appearances,

08:55.400 --> 08:57.840
worried our family ties
will grow even more strained.

08:59.040 --> 08:59.920
No, that's not it.

09:00.440 --> 09:03.640
I'm just… showing courtesy
before resorting to force.

09:05.320 --> 09:06.320
I believe you.

09:10.120 --> 09:11.600
We didn't even get to eat.

09:12.360 --> 09:14.400
I'm actually quite hungry.

09:15.040 --> 09:16.320
Me too.

09:17.120 --> 09:20.560
How about I cook something for you?
You can try my cooking.

09:23.560 --> 09:24.640
I'll cook for you.

09:29.720 --> 09:30.600
Dear,

09:31.800 --> 09:34.680
Jinglan has finally returned home,

09:35.840 --> 09:38.240
and he's now married
to the woman he loves.

09:39.160 --> 09:44.240
Can't you just let them be
and stop causing trouble for them?

09:46.240 --> 09:47.560
Master,

09:48.200 --> 09:50.040
are you worried I'll harm Jinglan?

09:53.840 --> 09:56.320
No, not harm, but use.

09:58.080 --> 10:01.880
Why did you let Jinglan's wife
attend the family banquet?

10:02.520 --> 10:05.920
And at the table,
why did you bring up the Bloom Society?

10:06.560 --> 10:07.400
Honestly,

10:07.480 --> 10:10.920
aren't you leveraging Yingying's courage
and Jinglan's position

10:11.000 --> 10:12.800
to deal with those relatives?

10:15.400 --> 10:19.240
Yingying married into our family
without a ceremony.

10:19.760 --> 10:23.920
Today, with the family elders present,
it's reasonable to introduce her.

10:27.000 --> 10:29.200
Yingying is talented and beautiful.

10:29.280 --> 10:31.960
You may not know her abilities now,

10:32.720 --> 10:34.800
but you'll see in time.

10:37.680 --> 10:39.360
Others may not know,

10:40.920 --> 10:42.640
but Jinglan stole his brother's fiancée.

10:44.880 --> 10:46.800
Still, now that she's part of our family,

10:46.880 --> 10:50.960
I hope they can live a good life together.

10:51.840 --> 10:54.080
I've always acted
for the good of the Yang family,

10:54.760 --> 10:55.880
with a clear conscience.

10:58.760 --> 11:02.080
No one questions
your loyalty to the Yang family.

11:02.960 --> 11:04.080
But…

11:05.960 --> 11:10.360
have you considered
what would happen if this fails?

11:11.280 --> 11:12.680
Look at Jingshan.

11:12.760 --> 11:15.000
He still refuses to marry.

11:16.040 --> 11:17.920
Isn't that lesson enough?

11:20.000 --> 11:22.240
Jinglan isn't the same as Jingshan,

11:23.240 --> 11:26.560
and Yingying isn't the same as Yuniang.

11:28.080 --> 11:31.560
Whether two people
who love each other can be together

11:31.640 --> 11:34.360
depends not on outside forces

11:34.440 --> 11:36.160
but on themselves.

11:39.360 --> 11:43.560
If two people love each other,
what obstacles could stand between them?

11:45.600 --> 11:48.040
Loving someone and marrying them
are two different things.

11:49.000 --> 11:51.640
Those who love each other
may not end up together.

11:52.640 --> 11:54.880
But couples like us,

11:55.680 --> 11:59.200
from compatible families,
respectful to each other,

11:59.720 --> 12:03.280
perhaps can stay together for a lifetime.

12:15.680 --> 12:16.760
Try it.

12:28.480 --> 12:29.640
How is it?

12:32.160 --> 12:35.000
Since my mother and master passed away,

12:35.640 --> 12:38.640
you're the first person to cook for me.

12:39.520 --> 12:40.560
These noodles

12:42.720 --> 12:43.920
taste like home.

12:49.480 --> 12:50.960
If you like it,

12:51.880 --> 12:53.520
I'll make it for you often.

12:54.320 --> 12:57.120
There's no need.
From now on, I'll cook for you.

13:11.200 --> 13:12.160
Just wait.

13:23.440 --> 13:25.120
Aren't you thinking about drinking?

13:27.920 --> 13:28.760
How did you know?

13:29.640 --> 13:31.200
You can't drink,

13:31.280 --> 13:33.120
but you can watch me drink.

13:36.160 --> 13:38.440
Fine, I'll watch you drink.

13:48.240 --> 13:49.480
What a fine wine.

13:50.720 --> 13:51.880
I'm envious.

13:57.280 --> 13:58.240
It smells amazing.

14:14.600 --> 14:16.200
Keep dreaming.

14:25.520 --> 14:26.760
Yang Jinglan,

14:27.360 --> 14:31.320
is life in the martial world as carefree
and joyful as it seems?

14:35.240 --> 14:37.400
Do you dislike being here that much?

15:00.040 --> 15:01.880
Then why stay here?

15:05.480 --> 15:06.440
For you.

15:16.720 --> 15:18.080
Why?

15:19.760 --> 15:21.320
Because we're allies?

15:23.880 --> 15:24.960
Ji Yingying,

15:26.840 --> 15:30.440
do you think we're just allies?

15:40.240 --> 15:42.160
Do you think everything I've done

15:44.400 --> 15:45.760
is merely

15:46.760 --> 15:48.600
because you're my ally?

15:55.440 --> 15:56.480
I don't know.

16:13.920 --> 16:14.960
I like you.

16:32.480 --> 16:33.360
What about you?

16:37.120 --> 16:38.240
What about you?

17:06.880 --> 17:08.240
Let me take you somewhere.

17:20.800 --> 17:23.240
MEMORIAL TABLET OF THE LATE LADY YANG

17:40.360 --> 17:41.560
I'm married,

17:42.960 --> 17:44.000
and I have a home now.

17:47.320 --> 17:48.440
This is Yingying,

17:49.560 --> 17:50.840
my wife.

17:52.560 --> 17:55.560
She is, and always will be,
my one and only wife.

18:02.400 --> 18:06.960
Madam, I am Ji Yingying,
your daughter-in-law.

18:09.320 --> 18:12.760
I know Jinglan has endured a lot
in the past.

18:13.360 --> 18:14.880
From now on,

18:14.960 --> 18:18.560
I'll ensure he takes care of his health
and stays happy every day.

18:19.640 --> 18:22.760
With your spirit watching over us,
rest assured.

18:36.360 --> 18:37.520
In the Yang family,

18:37.600 --> 18:40.360
sons have their own courtyard
from the age of five.

18:45.800 --> 18:49.040
But every day, I'd still come back here.

18:49.880 --> 18:53.120
This is the only place
I've ever missed when I was away.

18:55.760 --> 18:57.240
Is that a birdcage?

18:58.120 --> 18:58.960
Yes.

18:59.480 --> 19:00.480
It's so huge.

19:01.080 --> 19:02.920
My mother loved birds.

19:03.440 --> 19:09.000
She loved watching them chirp
and hop around in their cage.

19:10.080 --> 19:11.200
So, my father

19:11.840 --> 19:13.080
traveled far and wide,

19:13.160 --> 19:15.160
collecting all kinds of exotic species.

19:15.760 --> 19:18.680
He even had
this massive birdcage custom-made

19:19.280 --> 19:20.320
just to make her happy.

19:22.040 --> 19:23.280
My mother

19:26.800 --> 19:27.680
loved my father dearly.

19:31.480 --> 19:33.840
But bound by the rules of the Yang family,

19:33.920 --> 19:37.480
she became overly cautious,

19:39.240 --> 19:41.640
fearing she might trouble him.

19:43.720 --> 19:47.040
Gradually, she lost her freedom,

19:47.760 --> 19:49.040
lost herself,

19:51.360 --> 19:53.360
just like the birds in this cage,

19:54.200 --> 19:56.040
trapped within this courtyard.

19:59.200 --> 20:01.440
The day before she passed,

20:02.360 --> 20:04.800
she told me to open the cage

20:05.440 --> 20:07.680
and release all the birds.

20:08.760 --> 20:09.800
She said to me,

20:11.000 --> 20:14.400
"Give them back the freedom they deserve."

20:29.160 --> 20:30.080
Yingying,

20:30.800 --> 20:32.600
I won't be like my father.

20:34.120 --> 20:36.880
I want you to continue being yourself.

20:38.520 --> 20:41.680
I want us to meet and stay together,

20:42.200 --> 20:45.440
like a bird finding another bird,

20:46.080 --> 20:48.920
like a breeze meeting another breeze.

20:50.080 --> 20:52.800
To be happier, freer,

20:53.840 --> 20:56.600
more unrestrained, and more alive.

20:57.120 --> 21:01.240
But to me, you're not just a bird
or a breeze.

21:03.160 --> 21:04.280
You're the moon.

21:11.200 --> 21:13.080
I've walked this night journey alone
for so long.

21:13.600 --> 21:16.600
I thought I'd keep walking it by myself.

21:17.960 --> 21:20.200
But at some point,

21:20.280 --> 21:23.320
whenever I look up, I see the moon.

21:24.640 --> 21:27.440
Through every storm and season,
in all its phases and moods,

21:27.960 --> 21:29.640
it's always been there with me.

21:30.360 --> 21:34.000
It once told me
it would always support me.

21:35.840 --> 21:37.160
And it never broke that promise.

21:49.960 --> 21:51.880
I want to tell my moon,

21:53.200 --> 21:57.160
when all of this is over,
if it still longs for the martial world,

21:58.080 --> 22:00.160
I'll roam the land with it.

22:04.880 --> 22:09.560
Is this sword tassel
the one I rudely refused that day?

22:10.160 --> 22:11.120
Yes, it is.

22:22.640 --> 22:24.040
By the way,

22:24.800 --> 22:28.320
the Rippling Grain Brocade
was actually inspired by you.

22:30.080 --> 22:33.880
It was the light shining on you that day
that gave me the idea.

22:34.560 --> 22:36.000
I still remember you saying,

22:36.080 --> 22:39.840
"My promise as Yang Jinglan
is for a lifetime."

23:07.400 --> 23:08.440
REFINED PURSUITS

23:08.520 --> 23:09.520
Yingying!

23:10.560 --> 23:11.400
President!

23:11.920 --> 23:13.160
This is my first time seeing you
after the wedding.

23:14.080 --> 23:15.240
The Yang family acted so hastily.

23:15.320 --> 23:17.160
I didn't even get to make a scene
in your bridal chamber!

23:18.800 --> 23:20.480
Yang Jinglan was injured so badly.

23:20.560 --> 23:21.880
He didn't suffer any lasting damage,
did he?

23:21.960 --> 23:23.160
Sang Shisi!

23:23.240 --> 23:26.120
How can you say that
in front of an unmarried lady?

23:26.200 --> 23:27.240
Right.

23:27.920 --> 23:30.720
- But is he up to the task?
- Shut up!

23:32.000 --> 23:33.640
All right, that's enough joking around.

23:33.720 --> 23:35.680
I'm here today to discuss serious matters.

23:36.640 --> 23:38.800
- Pin, call everyone over.
- All right.

23:39.680 --> 23:40.800
- Stop laughing.
- Is he up to the task?

23:40.880 --> 23:42.000
- Stop laughing.
- Stop.

23:42.080 --> 23:43.920
I'll kick you to death!

23:45.960 --> 23:47.160
Rules!

23:49.560 --> 23:51.600
You're still wet behind the ears.

23:51.680 --> 23:53.640
What do you know about rules?

23:54.320 --> 23:56.880
What brings Second Uncle
to our Bloom Society?

23:57.720 --> 23:58.840
The Yang family.

23:59.720 --> 24:00.920
Ms. Ji,

24:01.440 --> 24:04.520
this Bloom Society
is under your name, right?

24:04.600 --> 24:06.640
And now that you've married
into the Yang family,

24:06.720 --> 24:08.360
from today on,

24:08.440 --> 24:10.800
Bloom Society will merge
with the Yang family!

24:20.120 --> 24:22.840
Bloom Society was jointly established
by many families.

24:22.920 --> 24:25.680
How can the Yang family
include the other families in this?

24:26.320 --> 24:27.640
The other families?

24:28.320 --> 24:30.520
Fine. I'll follow what you say.

24:31.040 --> 24:33.960
From now on, the other families
will co-manage with the Yang family.

24:34.040 --> 24:36.240
The Yang family runs things properly,

24:36.320 --> 24:38.640
so they'll take the larger share,

24:38.720 --> 24:40.120
and the other families
will take the smaller share.

24:40.200 --> 24:42.560
- That's settled then.
- Based on what?

24:43.840 --> 24:46.360
Because Ji Yingying is your president.

24:46.440 --> 24:48.560
Because she married into the Yang family.

24:48.640 --> 24:52.160
The Yang family's rules
must outweigh Bloom Society's. Got it?

24:53.120 --> 24:55.280
Second Uncle,
you really know how to play your cards.

24:55.960 --> 24:58.360
But Bloom Society
has nothing to do with me anymore.

24:59.480 --> 25:00.680
He's the new president.

25:01.280 --> 25:02.400
You can discuss this with him.

25:04.320 --> 25:05.320
Greetings, Sir Yang.

25:05.920 --> 25:09.920
I'm doing this
to help Bloom Society go further.

25:12.640 --> 25:14.360
Now that I'm a daughter-in-law
of the Yang family,

25:14.440 --> 25:17.080
if I continue
as president of Bloom Society,

25:17.600 --> 25:21.040
then Bloom Society will inevitably
become part of the Yang family.

25:22.160 --> 25:26.640
What it can do and what it cannot do
will all follow the Yang family's rules.

25:26.720 --> 25:29.320
This will greatly limit
Bloom Society's growth.

25:31.080 --> 25:32.600
So, for the long-term,

25:32.680 --> 25:34.720
I must step down as president.

25:45.320 --> 25:46.840
Yingying's concerns are valid.

25:47.360 --> 25:48.560
Just like today,

25:48.640 --> 25:50.760
you wouldn't want Bloom Society

25:50.840 --> 25:52.760
to be controlled by the Yang family
in the future, would you?

25:55.400 --> 25:57.040
Fine. Even if you're gone,

25:57.120 --> 25:59.880
this Bloom Society
will still have my protection.

26:00.840 --> 26:04.160
All right. What's most important now

26:04.240 --> 26:07.400
is choosing a new president
for Bloom Society.

26:08.680 --> 26:10.960
What? A new president?

26:13.840 --> 26:17.760
The new president must be talented
and able to earn everyone's respect.

26:18.480 --> 26:20.880
Not just talented, but also responsible.

26:20.960 --> 26:22.720
Ideally, they'd come from
a scholarly family

26:23.400 --> 26:24.880
and have charm and charisma.

26:24.960 --> 26:28.200
All right, everyone, if you trust me,
this position of president…

26:28.280 --> 26:29.600
According to you,

26:29.680 --> 26:33.400
must the new president
also be someone named Sang?

26:35.760 --> 26:36.960
All right.

26:37.040 --> 26:39.760
Here, at Bloom Society,
we do everything out in the open.

26:39.840 --> 26:41.680
We've always been transparent.

26:42.320 --> 26:43.840
Anyone who wants to take on
the role of president

26:43.920 --> 26:47.480
can raise their hand to vote.
Go ahead. Raise your hands!

26:50.720 --> 26:52.240
Come on. Raise your hands!

27:01.200 --> 27:02.040
All right.

27:02.640 --> 27:04.600
Those in favor of my elder brother
becoming president,

27:04.680 --> 27:05.600
please raise your hand.

27:09.680 --> 27:12.000
Those in favor of Mr. Chen
becoming president,

27:12.080 --> 27:12.920
please raise your hand.

27:31.360 --> 27:33.480
Currently, Mr. Chen has the most votes.

27:33.560 --> 27:38.120
So, the position of president
will go to Mr. Chen.

27:40.720 --> 27:42.480
My elder brother and Pin are tied.

27:42.560 --> 27:44.880
They'll both serve as vice presidents.

27:44.960 --> 27:46.720
For the new president's decisions,

27:46.800 --> 27:50.760
if the vice presidents disagree,
the decisions will be void.

27:53.760 --> 27:57.200
Ms. Ji, this isn't appropriate.

27:57.280 --> 27:59.880
Now that you've married
into the Yang family,

27:59.960 --> 28:03.040
how your assets are handled
should be decided by the Yang family.

28:03.120 --> 28:05.320
This… This isn't appropriate.

28:05.400 --> 28:07.520
Madam hasn't told me about this.

28:07.600 --> 28:09.320
Jinglan hasn't mentioned it either.

28:09.920 --> 28:12.280
Why are you teaching me the rules,
Second Uncle?

28:12.360 --> 28:15.360
Is the Yang family's rules
up to you to decide?

28:15.440 --> 28:17.080
Don't use Madam to pressure me.

28:17.160 --> 28:19.880
Let me tell you,
now we're in front of outsiders,

28:19.960 --> 28:21.200
and I'm the elder,

28:21.280 --> 28:22.880
if you oppose me,

28:22.960 --> 28:24.920
you're damaging
the Yang family's reputation.

28:25.000 --> 28:26.160
And that's a serious matter.

28:26.240 --> 28:28.320
Pardon my interruption.

28:28.880 --> 28:33.360
Is your intention about
the ownership of Bloom Society?

28:35.920 --> 28:37.000
Exactly.

28:37.080 --> 28:38.920
You're quite perceptive.

28:40.720 --> 28:44.160
I know you all
have a good relationship with Ms. Ji.

28:44.240 --> 28:46.480
If you don't want to see her bullied
in the Yang family

28:46.560 --> 28:47.640
in the future,

28:47.720 --> 28:49.320
you'd better align yourselves with me.

28:49.840 --> 28:51.640
Of course, in business,

28:51.720 --> 28:55.400
I'll be generous to everyone.
What do you say?

28:57.480 --> 28:59.320
Sir Yang, you're truly generous.

29:00.400 --> 29:03.720
Now that I'm the new president,
it's only right to make some changes.

29:05.520 --> 29:09.440
So, Sir Yang, you can leave
the same way you came.

29:14.960 --> 29:16.200
Say that again.

29:16.920 --> 29:18.200
Oh, I nearly forgot.

29:18.280 --> 29:20.080
I can't decide this matter on my own.

29:21.120 --> 29:23.080
I'll need to consult
with my two vice presidents

29:24.120 --> 29:26.640
and the members of Bloom Society.

29:26.720 --> 29:28.280
Do you agree with my decision?

29:28.360 --> 29:29.360
We agree!

29:29.440 --> 29:30.880
Leave the same way you came!

29:31.680 --> 29:33.960
All of Yizhou City knows

29:34.840 --> 29:37.720
it's Mrs. Yang who calls the shots
in the Yang family.

29:37.800 --> 29:41.000
I have no idea about your standing
in the Yang family.

29:41.960 --> 29:43.760
Don't think that invoking the Yang family

29:43.840 --> 29:47.000
gives you the right
to act recklessly here.

29:49.520 --> 29:51.560
This is our first meeting,

29:51.640 --> 29:54.760
so I won't hit you
for causing trouble here.

29:54.840 --> 29:55.720
No, I won't hit you.

29:57.120 --> 29:59.000
But if you continue spouting nonsense,

29:59.520 --> 30:00.920
I'll show you

30:01.000 --> 30:03.480
what the men of Huanhua Creek
are capable of!

30:12.800 --> 30:13.720
Ms. Ji,

30:14.480 --> 30:15.800
just you wait!

30:15.880 --> 30:17.880
You've humiliated
your second uncle outside.

30:17.960 --> 30:20.280
The Yang family won't let this slide!

30:28.240 --> 30:31.160
President,
am I fit to be the new president?

30:32.480 --> 30:34.320
You have to believe in yourself.

30:35.840 --> 30:37.080
From now on,

30:37.160 --> 30:39.680
Bloom Society will have only Mr. Chen
as president,

30:39.760 --> 30:40.800
not Ji Yingying.

30:43.160 --> 30:45.320
We both came out of Bloom Society.

30:45.840 --> 30:49.400
You carried the banner,
while I led the fights.

30:50.640 --> 30:53.360
Reaching this point, I should step up.

30:54.360 --> 30:58.200
But I still feel
there's quite a gap between us.

31:02.200 --> 31:04.440
Get the banner.
Let's head to Huanhua Creek

31:04.520 --> 31:06.120
to hold the ceremony
for the new president!

31:06.200 --> 31:08.640
Got it. I'll get it!

31:10.760 --> 31:12.040
Let's go.

31:12.120 --> 31:13.000
Let's go.

31:13.520 --> 31:14.960
Let's go, new president.

31:16.440 --> 31:17.640
Stop teasing me.

31:17.720 --> 31:21.240
Shisi, don't be jealous.
Next time, it's your turn.

31:27.680 --> 31:28.520
Hey.

31:29.040 --> 31:30.200
What are you writing?

31:40.160 --> 31:43.520
"Yang Jinglan, male, from Yizhou.

31:43.600 --> 31:46.440
In his youth, he loved
horseback riding and swordplay…"

31:47.040 --> 31:48.040
What?

31:48.560 --> 31:50.480
Are you writing your own confession?

31:50.560 --> 31:52.960
She wants to understand me more deeply,

31:53.040 --> 31:55.080
and I want to tell her.

31:55.600 --> 31:58.040
Right now, the two of us

31:58.720 --> 32:00.080
are growing closer.

32:03.600 --> 32:06.800
How much closer do you want to be
now that you're already married?

32:08.160 --> 32:12.920
Marriage makes some things harder to say.

32:13.920 --> 32:16.200
No matter what, I wish you both

32:16.960 --> 32:18.360
harmony and happiness.

32:18.440 --> 32:19.640
May you grow old together.

32:22.600 --> 32:24.840
Marriage is just a stopgap measure.

32:25.440 --> 32:28.400
A stopgap measure?
What, are you planning to break it off?

32:28.480 --> 32:30.880
- Don't you want to marry her anymore?
- What are you saying?

32:30.960 --> 32:32.040
Is that what I meant?

32:33.080 --> 32:38.240
I mean, even if I married her,
I can't disregard her feelings.

32:38.760 --> 32:40.160
For us, marriage

32:40.240 --> 32:44.000
is the beginning of our relationship,
not the end.

32:58.440 --> 32:59.520
What's wrong?

33:00.080 --> 33:01.040
Not drinking anymore?

33:02.360 --> 33:03.720
Ms. Yu told me

33:03.800 --> 33:06.120
this is your favorite wine.

33:06.200 --> 33:07.360
It is.

33:07.440 --> 33:09.480
It's my favorite wine.

33:10.400 --> 33:12.040
But Yingying told me

33:12.960 --> 33:14.480
I shouldn't drink.

33:20.640 --> 33:22.000
The foreign merchants
are still under investigation.

33:22.080 --> 33:24.640
Both openly and secretly,
many merchants head to Nanzhao.

33:24.720 --> 33:27.000
It'll take some time to sort it all out.

33:27.840 --> 33:30.360
Bai Sheng's place
is also under surveillance.

33:31.400 --> 33:34.120
But there are guards
outside his residence,

33:34.640 --> 33:36.640
so our people can't get too close.

33:38.000 --> 33:42.360
Zhuge, send someone to Nanzhao again
and ask Gao to bring me something.

33:43.080 --> 33:43.960
What thing?

33:44.040 --> 33:46.480
Something that exposes

33:47.360 --> 33:50.280
someone's true self.

33:59.120 --> 34:02.920
The banner is here!

34:09.760 --> 34:11.600
Back then, we came together

34:12.360 --> 34:14.760
because the big dyehouses
forced us into a corner.

34:15.360 --> 34:17.600
We were just trying to survive.

34:18.880 --> 34:20.719
Eventually, we found a path to success.

34:21.280 --> 34:23.159
Bloom Society thrived,

34:23.719 --> 34:27.400
giving every small dyehouse
a way to prosper.

34:36.000 --> 34:37.120
Mr. Chen,

34:37.639 --> 34:41.120
today, I'm handing over
the presidency of Bloom Society to you.

34:56.360 --> 34:57.240
Let me ask you.

34:58.760 --> 35:02.480
Do you still remember the oath we swore
when we founded Bloom Society?

35:10.440 --> 35:12.880
We would never judge a person
by their background,

35:13.640 --> 35:15.240
never remain stagnant,

35:15.880 --> 35:17.640
and never exclude outsiders.

35:18.240 --> 35:20.080
Together, we would move forward,

35:21.640 --> 35:22.800
making a name for ourselves in Yizhou!

35:29.080 --> 35:32.240
What I achieved, you have also achieved.

35:33.320 --> 35:36.600
From now on,
you can establish the rules you see fit.

35:38.000 --> 35:39.240
From this day forward,

35:39.880 --> 35:42.400
Bloom Society will always
have a place for you.

35:43.440 --> 35:45.080
If Ji Yingying ever needs help,

35:45.600 --> 35:48.200
Bloom Society will provide full support!

35:50.400 --> 35:52.640
I told you to establish rules
for Bloom Society,

35:52.720 --> 35:54.200
not to pledge loyalty to me.

35:56.200 --> 36:01.280
If Ji Yingying ever needs help,
Bloom Society will provide full support!

36:01.360 --> 36:02.200
Pin!

36:03.600 --> 36:07.760
If Ji Yingying ever needs help,
Bloom Society will provide full support!

36:07.840 --> 36:13.040
If Ji Yingying ever needs help,
Bloom Society will provide full support!

36:13.640 --> 36:19.120
If Ji Yingying ever needs help,
Bloom Society will provide full support!

36:19.200 --> 36:24.000
If Ji Yingying ever needs help,
Bloom Society will provide full support!

36:24.080 --> 36:26.320
- Enough…
- If Ji Yingying ever needs help,

36:26.400 --> 36:29.800
Bloom Society will provide full support!

36:29.880 --> 36:35.440
If Ji Yingying ever needs help,
Bloom Society will provide full support!

36:54.840 --> 36:55.720
All right.

36:58.960 --> 36:59.880
Enough…

37:02.880 --> 37:04.640
Isn't this Mr. Bai?

37:05.720 --> 37:08.200
Long time no see. What brings you here?

37:09.720 --> 37:10.720
I'm here to see Ms. Ji.

37:11.640 --> 37:14.000
You want to see Ms. Ji? Why?

37:14.080 --> 37:15.320
You can just talk to me.

37:21.000 --> 37:22.720
Last time, I failed to offer help
in your time of need.

37:22.800 --> 37:25.560
Today,
I've come specifically to apologize.

37:31.840 --> 37:33.240
Well, hold on.

37:36.400 --> 37:37.280
President…

37:37.360 --> 37:40.240
No, former president,
I think there's a problem.

37:40.320 --> 37:42.320
He didn't show up when we were in trouble.

37:42.400 --> 37:44.200
I think you should be cautious.

37:44.280 --> 37:46.640
I understand. You all can go back now.

37:47.160 --> 37:50.520
I'll hear what Mr. Bai has to say.

37:57.800 --> 37:59.440
Go ahead, Mr. Bai.

38:05.560 --> 38:11.080
If it were to happen again,
I might still say the same thing.

38:14.080 --> 38:15.480
That I should serve as a servant?

38:16.600 --> 38:17.880
Serve as a servant?

38:19.680 --> 38:22.600
Ms. Ji, have you misunderstood?
That was never my intention.

38:24.800 --> 38:27.360
So, you didn't come
to apologize today after all.

38:30.480 --> 38:33.120
Well, I'm just a simple merchant.

38:33.200 --> 38:34.600
Business is business.

38:35.640 --> 38:38.280
Ruining things
with such a great business partner

38:38.360 --> 38:39.480
is the last thing I want.

38:39.560 --> 38:40.640
Besides,

38:41.360 --> 38:43.200
in Yizhou's brocade industry,

38:43.280 --> 38:46.280
I can't avoid you, and you can't avoid me.

38:46.360 --> 38:49.880
So, why don't we shake hands
and make peace?

38:51.400 --> 38:53.600
Sheng Fengze…

38:55.240 --> 38:56.760
Bai Sheng…

38:58.840 --> 39:00.800
Could they be the same person?

39:03.120 --> 39:04.280
It's possible.

39:09.480 --> 39:11.000
I agree with your perspective.

39:11.800 --> 39:15.360
We're in the same city. Why be at odds?

39:16.880 --> 39:19.320
But a business partner
who takes advantage of others' crises

39:20.120 --> 39:21.440
is something I cannot accept.

39:24.880 --> 39:29.760
Well, Ms. Ji, your words
are quite disheartening to me.

39:30.480 --> 39:34.560
All I did was name a price,
and you refused to accept it.

39:34.640 --> 39:36.280
How is that taking advantage
of someone in distress?

39:36.880 --> 39:41.840
Besides, I do have
genuine feelings for you.

39:45.320 --> 39:46.640
I see now.

39:46.720 --> 39:49.040
You didn't come to apologize today.

39:49.120 --> 39:50.680
You came to confess your feelings.

39:51.760 --> 39:55.800
Very well.
Thank you for your genuine feelings.

39:56.920 --> 39:59.680
If there's nothing else,
I'll take my leave now.

40:35.000 --> 40:35.840
Ms. Ji,

40:37.640 --> 40:38.760
it's raining.

40:38.840 --> 40:41.720
How about I escort you home?

40:45.760 --> 40:48.480
A light rain like this
is nothing to worry about.

40:48.560 --> 40:49.800
Thank you, Mr. Bai.

40:58.360 --> 41:01.400
Since you've already accepted
my genuine feelings,

41:01.920 --> 41:04.800
then holding an umbrella for you
and shielding you from the rain

41:04.880 --> 41:06.240
shouldn't be surprising, right?

41:09.040 --> 41:09.920
Dear!

41:10.440 --> 41:13.480
It's raining. I've come to take you home!

41:23.480 --> 41:25.760
My husband is here to escort me home.
Thank you, Mr. Bai.

41:30.120 --> 41:32.200
Thank you, Mr. Bai, for escorting my wife!

41:32.800 --> 41:34.520
Mr. Yang,
did your legs get injured like this

41:34.600 --> 41:36.000
because you've walked
too many dark paths at night?

41:36.080 --> 41:37.760
Otherwise, it wouldn't be this serious.

41:38.800 --> 41:40.840
So, let me offer you some advice.

41:40.920 --> 41:42.680
Avoid walking dark paths at night.

41:42.760 --> 41:44.200
Your fall might be even worse next time.

41:45.360 --> 41:46.240
Dear,

41:47.360 --> 41:48.240
let's go home.

42:23.840 --> 42:25.280
Bai Sheng is very dangerous.

42:26.040 --> 42:27.520
You shouldn't meet him alone.

42:28.320 --> 42:31.120
And even more so,
you shouldn't get any closer to him.

42:31.200 --> 42:33.080
I know what I'm doing.

42:33.920 --> 42:36.600
On the surface,
Bai Sheng is still just a merchant.

42:37.520 --> 42:39.800
His appearance in Yizhou as a businessman

42:39.880 --> 42:41.680
is certainly no coincidence.

42:42.200 --> 42:43.480
Since that's the case,

42:43.560 --> 42:45.720
I still have a role to play
in this matter.

42:45.800 --> 42:47.600
You're planning to continue
doing business with him?

42:49.720 --> 42:50.920
That Bai Sheng…

42:51.000 --> 42:53.560
If you ask me, he's more interested in you

42:54.400 --> 42:56.240
than in business.
